{"id": 25, "ts": 1780595772.8163607, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s clarification that there are no documented incidents where Candidate\u202fD\u2019s hot temper has translated into crew\u2011cooperation problems or safety\u2011critical lapses. While his strengths\u2014high responsibility, excellent problem\u2011solving, strong concentration, and adequate response to unexpected events\u2014are valuable for long\u2011haul operations, we still lack evidence on his stress resilience, decision quality under pressure, and day\u2011to\u2011day professional communication. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB\u2019s record includes proven stress handling, conscientious reliability, and solid technical competence (weather assessment and computer skills), with only unsubstantiated concerns about occasional pretentious tone. Given the current evidence, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fB offers the most balanced fit for the role."}
